[39.211619, "o", "ERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-11\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R3: residual 2 < inherent 6, but no listed control can take the credit (no controls). No credit for planned or unproven controls.\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-11\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R5: residual 1 < inherent 4, but no listed control can take the credit (C12 is planned). No credit for planned or unproven controls.\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-12\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R6: residual 9 is above the appetite (3): a named person must accept it (accepted_by)\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-13\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R6: the AI policy does not allow accepting a risk of 9: mitigate or avoid it\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-12\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R7: residual 6 is above the appetite (3): a named person must accept it (accepted_by)\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-12\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R8: residual 4 is above the appetite (3): a named person must accept it (accepted_by)\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-11\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R9: residual 3 < inherent 6, but no listed control can take the credit (C23 has no valid evidence). No credit for planned or unproven controls.\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-14\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R9: review_date 2027-12-01 must be after the assessment and within 183 days of it\r\nERROR   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-11\u001b[m\u001b[K  risk R11: residual 2 < inherent 6, but no listed control can take the credit (C07 has no valid evidence). No credit for planned or unproven controls.\r\n22 error(s), 3 warning(s)  [ASM-01, ASM-02, COV-01, EVD-02, EVD-03, EVD-04, REG-02, REG-06, REG-07, REG-08, REG-09, \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-11\u001b[m\u001b[K, \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-12\u001b[m\u001b[K, \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-13\u001b[m\u001b[K, \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KREG-14\u001b[m\u001b[K]\r\n"]
