[176.49755, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[K2\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K<!-- TSG Helpdesk chat widget (lab copy). The text inside \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kid=\"greeting\"\u001b[m\u001b[K is the first message every\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[K8\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K    <p \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kid=\"greeting\"\u001b[m\u001b[K>Hello, I am the TSG Shop AI assistant, an automated system. Ask for a person at any time. I can help with orders, deliveries and refunds. What do you need?</p>\r\n"]
